sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Worker as Background Outbox Worker

    Patient->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/bookings + Idempotency-Key
    Note over FastAPI: Authenticate JWT, Authorize Patient Role,<br/>Validate Request Schema & Hash Payload

    FastAPI->>DB: Check idempotency_records (scope='bookings:create', key=Idempotency-Key)
    alt Idempotency Record Exists
        alt Payload Hash Matches
            DB-->>FastAPI: Return Cached Result
            FastAPI-->>Patient: 201 Created (Original Idempotent Response)
        else Payload Hash Mismatched
            FastAPI-->>Patient: 409 Conflict (IDEMPOTENCY_PAYLOAD_MISMATCH)
        end
    else New Request Key
        FastAPI->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (SERIALIZABLE / SELECT FOR UPDATE)
        FastAPI->>DB: SELECT * FROM availability_slots WHERE id = :slot_id FOR UPDATE
        
        alt Slot Available and Doctor Verified
            DB-->>FastAPI: Slot Locked (status='AVAILABLE')
            FastAPI->>DB: UPDATE availability_slots SET status='BOOKED' WHERE id = :slot_id
            FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO consultations (id, patient_id, doctor_id, slot_id, status='SCHEDULED')
            FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO idempotency_records (key, scope, request_hash, status_code=201, response_body)
            FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO outbox_events (event_type='BOOKING_CONFIRMED', payload)
            FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='BOOKING_CREATED', actor_id=patient_id)
            FastAPI->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
            FastAPI-->>Patient: 201 Created { consultation_id, status: "SCHEDULED", slot }

            critical Async Event Processing
                Worker->>DB: Poll PENDING events FROM outbox_events
                Worker->>Worker: Dispatch SMS/Email Confirmation
                Worker->>DB: UPDATE outbox_events SET status='PROCESSED'
            end
        else Slot Unavailable or Already Booked
            DB-->>FastAPI: Slot Locked (status != 'AVAILABLE')
            FastAPI->>DB: ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
            FastAPI-->>Patient: 409 Conflict (SLOT_ALREADY_RESERVED)
        end
    end
